{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09512","headline":"云南曲 · 刘湾","name":"云南曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"百蛮乱南方，羣盗如蝟起。\n骚然疲中原，征战从此始。\n白门太和城，来往一万里。\n去者无全生，十人九人死。\n岱马卧阳山，燕兵哭泸水。\n妻行求死夫，父行求死子。\n苍天满愁云，白骨积空垒。\n哀哀云南行，十万同已矣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘湾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09512.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09512","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}